          "date": "2026-10-30 22:28:44.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-20984 ptlrpc: bound ptlrpc_gss load in policy lookup",
        "message": "LU-20984 ptlrpc: bound ptlrpc_gss load in policy lookup\n\nsptlrpc_wireflavor2policy() calls request_module(\"ptlrpc_gss\") when\na GSS or GSSIAM flavor has no registered policy, and repeats until\nthe policy appears.  If the module cannot be loaded, or loads but\ndoes not register that policy (as for GSSIAM currently), the lookup\nnever returns and the calling thread, which can be a service thread\nhandling an incoming request, keeps running modprobe.\n\nTry the load at most once per lookup and fail the lookup if the\npolicy is still missing, so the caller rejects the flavor.  After a\nfailed attempt, do not retry the load for that policy for a few\nseconds, so that lookups do not each wait for modprobe.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: b80d6defb7b0 (\"LU-16888 gss: fix ptlrpc_gss automatic loading\")\nFixes: 7c7f10e48354 (\"LU-19921 sec: add GSSIAM nodemap integration and export setup\")\nSigned-off-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5 ltvm llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I565f73644bbabcf3cd0f3a13cee431f4380a64d9\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
